contentText:
Alex Warren &#8216;s fans aren&#8217;t your ordinary fanbase. In his conversation with Megan Moroney for Rolling Stone &#8216;s Musicians on Musicians issue, the TikToker-turned-singer shared that his listeners have taken to bringing loved ones&#8217; ashes to his shows for him to autograph.

